sequenceDiagram
    participant U as User<br/>用户
    participant PS as Prompt Stack<br/>提示词栈
    participant QE as QueryEngine<br/>会话宿主
    participant QL as query.ts<br/>轮次循环
    participant TP as Tool Pipeline<br/>工具执行流水线
    participant T as Tools<br/>工具

    U->>PS: 任务输入 / 约束
    PS->>QE: 组装 prompt 与 context
    QE->>QL: 启动 turn loop
    QL->>TP: 决定是否调用工具
    TP->>T: 执行 tool
    T-->>TP: tool result
    TP-->>QL: 回灌 messages
    QL-->>QE: 继续 / 收敛
